* official Analog Canvas netlist; PDK X cards rewritten by convert.py
.model nch nmos
.model pch pmos

.subckt dut VDD VSS VB2 VREF VB1 VB3 VB4 IBUF VIN VOUT
CL VOUT net5 1p
M10 net1 VB1 net13 VDD pch l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
